    "intro_narrative": "You awaken in the stifling boiler room of the HMS Leviathan, a colossal steampunk airship suspended amidst the clouds. The deafening hiss of escaping steam and the erratic ticking of giant brass gears signal an imminent disaster: the main engines have stalled, and the ship is rapidly losing altitude. Surrounding you is a labyrinth of copper pipes, sputtering valves, and complex mechanical computation devices created by the ship's mad architect. Your only hope of survival is to restore power to the primary engine system. To do this, you must navigate a sequence of clockwork machines, decipher aetheric punch cards, and meticulously calibrate the pressure engines. Every gear must turn in perfect sequence. The clock is ticking, and the clouds below are rushing closer.",
    "narrative_style": "steampunk"
  },
